<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Peça Ajuda | Solution Tech</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: #f7f9fc;
            color: #172033;
        }

        button, input, select {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        }

        /* =========================
           CABEÇALHO
        ========================= */

        .header {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 16px 7%;
            background: white;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .logo-icon {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #2563eb;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 13px;
            font-size: 22px;
        }

        .logo strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 19px;
        }

        .logo span {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 3px;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #64748b;
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        nav a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #2563eb;
        }

        /* =========================
           SELEÇÃO DE PERFIL / CADASTRO DE ACESSO
        ========================= */

        .user-profile-bar {
            background: #eff6ff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
            padding: 12px 7%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .profile-options {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .profile-btn {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #2563eb;
            color: #2563eb;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .profile-btn.active {
            background: #2563eb;
            color: white;
        }

        .profile-form-inline {
            display: none;
            gap: 10px;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .profile-form-inline.visible {
            display: flex;
        }

        .input-inline {
            padding: 6px 10px;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        /* =========================
           HERO / PRIMEIRA PÁGINA
        ========================= */

        .hero {
            padding: 60px 7%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eaf2ff, white 55%, #effcf4);
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 1150px;
            margin: auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
            gap: 55px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 7px 12px;
            background: #dbeafe;
            color: #2563eb;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 60px);
            line-height: 1.05;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: #2563eb;
        }

        .hero p {
            max-width: 650px;
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .btn {
            border: 0;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            border-radius: 11px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: #2563eb;
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #1d4ed8;
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: white;
            color: #2563eb;
            border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
        }

        /* =========================
           ROBÔ
        ========================= */

        .robot-card {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 25px;
            padding: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(15,23,42,.12);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .robot {
            width: 150px;
            height: 145px;
            margin: 0 auto 15px;
            position: relative;
            animation: flutuar 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes flutuar {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
        }

        .robot-head {
            width: 95px;
            height: 75px;
            background: #2563eb;
            border-radius: 28px;
            position: absolute;
            left: 27px;
            top: 20px;
        }

        .robot-head::before,
        .robot-head::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 13px;
            height: 13px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            top: 25px;
        }

        .robot-head::before { left: 22px; }
        .robot-head::after { right: 22px; }

        .robot-mouth {
            position: absolute;
            left: 30px;
            right: 30px;
            bottom: 12px;
            height: 8px;
            background: #dbeafe;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .robot-antenna {
            position: absolute;
            width: 5px;
            height: 20px;
            background: #2563eb;
            left: 73px;
            top: 0;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        .robot-antenna::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 11px;
            height: 11px;
            background: #22c55e;
            border-radius: 50%;
            left: -3px;
            top: -7px;
        }

        .robot-body {
            width: 75px;
            height: 45px;
            background: #dbeafe;
            border-radius: 16px;
            position: absolute;
            left: 37px;
            top: 92px;
        }

        .robot-arm {
            position: absolute;
            width: 25px;
            height: 8px;
            background: #2563eb;
            border-radius: 8px;
            top: 102px;
        }

        .robot-arm.left {
            left: 16px;
            transform: rotate(20deg);
            animation: acenar 1.5s infinite;
        }

        .robot-arm.right {
            right: 16px;
            transform: rotate(-20deg);
        }

        @keyframes acenar {
            50% { transform: rotate(45deg); }
        }

        .robot-speech {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 14px;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .speak-button {
            margin-top: 12px;
            border: 0;
            background: #2563eb;
            color: white;
            padding: 11px 16px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .speak-button:hover { background: #1d4ed8; }

        .voice-status {
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #64748b;
        }

        /* =========================
           SEÇÕES
        ========================= */

        .section {
            max-width: 1150px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 70px 25px;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 34px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .section-title p {
            color: #64748b;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* =========================
           PASSO A PASSO
        ========================= */

        .steps {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .step {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 22px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .step-number {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            margin: 0 auto 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #2563eb;
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .step-icon {
            font-size: 34px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .step strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 7px;
        }

        .step p {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #64748b;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .step-speak {
            margin-top: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
            background: #eff6ff;
            color: #2563eb;
            border-radius: 9px;
            padding: 8px 11px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* =========================
           SERVIÇOS / ASSISTENTE
        ========================= */

        .services-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .service-card {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 24px;
            text-align: left;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: .2s;
            min-height: 155px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: flex-start;
        }

        .service-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            border-color: #93c5fd;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(15,23,42,.08);
        }

        .service-icon {
            width: 52px;
            height: 52px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #eff6ff;
            border-radius: 14px;
            font-size: 26px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .service-card strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 7px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .service-card span {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .project-credit {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .group-name {
            display: block;
            color: #2563eb;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .project-name {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        /* =========================
           DOAÇÃO
        ========================= */

        .donation-box {
            background: #172033;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 45px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
            gap: 35px;
            align-items: start;
        }

        .donation-box h2 {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .donation-box p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .donation-form {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 16px;
        }

        .donation-form h3 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #93c5fd;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        .form-group input, .form-group select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #475569;
            background: #0f172a;
            color: white;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .form-group input:focus, .form-group select:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #2563eb;
        }

        .btn-donate {
            width: 100%;
            background: #2563eb;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .btn-donate:hover {
            background: #1d4ed8;
        }

        .donation-status {
            margin-top: 12px;
            font-size: 13px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* =========================
           RODAPÉ
        ========================= */

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            background: white;
            border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            color: #64748b;
        }

        footer strong {
            color: #172033;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        footer p {
            margin: 7px 0;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        /* =========================
           RESPONSIVIDADE (CELULAR)
        ========================= */

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .hero-content { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            .services-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            .donation-box { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .header { padding: 14px 20px; }
            nav { display: none; }
            .hero { padding: 40px 20px; }
            .hero-buttons { flex-direction: column; }
            .btn { width: 100%; }
            .steps, .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .section { padding: 45px 20px; }
            .donation-box { padding: 25px 18px; }
            .user-profile-bar { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- ==================================================
     CABEÇALHO
================================================== -->
<header class="header">
    <div class="logo">
        <div class="logo-icon">❤</div>
        <div>
            <strong>Peça Ajuda</strong>
            <span>Conectando pessoas a oportunidades de ajuda</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <nav>
        <a href="#inicio">Início</a>
        <a href="#passos">Como usar</a>
        <a href="#servicos">Serviços</a>
        <a href="#doacoes">Doações</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<!-- BARRA DE ACESSO DO USUÁRIO (ANÔNIMO OU IDENTIFICADO) -->
<div class="user-profile-bar">
    <div class="profile-options">
        <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #334155;">Tipo de Acesso:</span>
        <button id="btnAnonimo" class="profile-btn active" onclick="selecionarPerfil('anonimo')">👤 Anônimo</button>
        <button id="btnIdentificado" class="profile-btn" onclick="selecionarPerfil('identificado')">🪪 Com Cadastro (Nome/CPF)</button>
    </div>

    <div id="formPerfilInline" class="profile-form-inline">
        <input type="text" id="userNome" class="input-inline" placeholder="Seu Nome completo">
        <input type="text" id="userCPF" class="input-inline" placeholder="CPF (Apenas números)" maxlength="14" oninput="mascaraCPF(this)">
        <button class="profile-btn active" style="border:none;" onclick="salvarPerfil()">Salvar</button>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ==================================================
     INÍCIO
================================================== -->
<section class="hero" id="inicio">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <div>
            <span class="tag">PROJETO SOCIAL</span>
            <h1>Informação pode <span>mudar vidas.</span></h1>
            <p>
                O Peça Ajuda facilita o acesso a informações sobre abrigos, alimentação, higiene, saúde, roupas e outros serviços de apoio em <strong>Maringá - Paraná.</strong>
            </p>

            <div class="hero-buttons">
                <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="irParaPassos()">🤖 Como pedir ajuda</button>
                <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="abrirMapa('assistência social')">📍 Ajuda em Maringá</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ROBÔ -->
        <div class="robot-card">
            <div class="robot">
                <div class="robot-antenna"></div>
                <div class="robot-head">
                    <div class="robot-mouth"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="robot-body"></div>
                <div class="robot-arm left"></div>
                <div class="robot-arm right"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="robot-speech" id="robotSpeech">
                Olá! Eu sou o robô Peça Ajuda. Vou mostrar como encontrar ajuda em Maringá.
            </div>

            <button class="speak-button" onclick="falarMensagemInicial()">🔊 Ouvir o robô</button>
            <div class="voice-status" id="voiceStatus">Clique no botão para ouvir.</div>
        </div>
